# Keeps the build context small and stops host artifacts from leaking into an
# image. node_modules especially: host-built native modules and symlinks do not
# transfer, so every stage installs its own.

node_modules
**/node_modules

dist
**/dist
dist-test
**/dist-test
*.tsbuildinfo
.turbo
**/.turbo

.git
.github
.husky
.vscode

coverage
**/coverage

.env
**/.env
!**/.env.example

*.vsix
**/out

.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
*.log

Dockerfile
**/Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
.dockerignore
